${csr_handler}=                 Catenate  SEPARATOR= | ...  if request.IsRead:                                                  ${
}${SPACE} | ...      cpu.DebugLog('CSR read!')                                       ${
} | ...  elif request.IsWrite:                                               ${
}${SPACE} | ...      cpu.DebugLog('CSR written!') | Create Machine 64 | Create Log Tester               0 | Register Failing Log String     CSR read! | Execute Command                 logLevel 0 | Execute Command                 cpu RegisterCSRHandlerFromString 0x7c0 "${csr_handler}" | Execute Command                 cpu AssembleBlock ${starting_pc} "csrrwi x0, 0x7c0, 13" | Execute Command                 cpu Step 1 | Wait For Log Entry              CSR written!

